# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore - San Francisco Restaurant Hygiene & Safety Analytics Portfolio
# Standard Data Analytics / BI Project Git Hygiene
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. TEMPORARY & LOCK FILES (MICROSOFT OFFICE & POWER BI)
# Jangan biarkan file lock sementara Office ter-commit ke GitHub saat PPTX/PBIX dibuka!
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*.pptx
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pbix
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. PYTHON & ENVIRONMENT ARTIFACTS
# File cache bytecode dan virtual environment lokal
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Virtual Environments
.env
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. JUPYTER NOTEBOOK CHECKPOINTS
# Cache autosave Jupyter yang mengotori riwayat commit
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*
*.nbconvert/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OPERATING SYSTEM ARTIFACTS
# File cache sistem operasi (Windows & macOS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. IDE & CODE EDITOR SETTINGS
# Konfigurasi personal editor (VS Code, JetBrains, dll.)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. SCRATCH, LOGS & TESTING DRAFTS
# Folder sementara atau file uji coba sekali pakai
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
temp/
tmp/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. SENSITIVE CREDENTIALS & SECRETS
# Menjaga keamanan API key, kredensial database, dan konfigurasi rahasia
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.cert
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.private.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. LARGE DATABASE TEMPORARY / WAL FILES
# File rollback journal SQLite saat query sedang dieksekusi
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite-journal

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. REDUNDANT DUPLICATE RAW FILES
# Cegah duplikasi file data mentah di luar folder data/raw
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/Restaurant_Scores_-_LIVES_Standard.csv
data/Shapefiles (2)/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 10. INTERNAL WORKING NOTES & DRAFTS
# Catatan kerja dan referensi belajar internal (tidak untuk publik)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tentang_dataset.md
kesimpulan.md
alur_kerja_data_analyst.md


